Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:01:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Refuse filing until a Buwiz account is signed in

Host verbs, menus that open data, and the global show hotkey stay closed
until a device sign-in is approved. Debug tests and the demo launcher opt
out only when EBIR_TEST_ENV and BIR_AUTH_BYPASS are both set. Release
builds compile that bypass out.
